  "solution": {
    "text": "Hint: $\\left(x^2 \\log _x 27\\right) \\cdot \\log _9 x=x+4$\n$\\begin{aligned}\n& \\Rightarrow x^2 \\cdot \\log _9 27=x+4 \\Rightarrow x^2 \\cdot \\log _{3^2} 3^3=x+4 \\Rightarrow \\frac{3}{2} x^2=x+4 \\\\\n& \\Rightarrow 3 x^2-2 x-8=0 \\Rightarrow 3 x^2-6 x+4 x-8=0 \\Rightarrow(3 x+4)(x-2)=0 \\\\\n& x \\neq-\\frac{4}{3} \\therefore x=2\n\\end{aligned}$",
    "image": null
